Make the upstream Screen resolution option call SDL's window/display APIs.

The original callback only rearranges widgets, without resizing the window
or its surfaces. Desktop fullscreen also deliberately ignores the requested
mode. Use exclusive fullscreen for a selected mode, retaining the preferred
monitor mode on first launch. Windowed mode uses SDL_SetWindowSize. Rebuild
surfaces before reflowing the UI and retire the old map allocation.

This is a client bug independent of Kandelo. No custom dimensions, display
scale, rendering transform, or platform-specific behavior is introduced.

